  "statement": "For the hash-pinned A1 production coefficients and A10-A13 strict sharp cubes, all prior A13 reductions remain binding at T4. R-071 corrects R-070's false raw linear regularity attribution and closes the complete fixed-floor symmetric--Cartan linear frame through the R-050 enhanced matrix one-form. A13-CLASSII-PHASE-KERNEL-CAUSAL-DIAGONAL-ONE-USE-REDUCTION now classifies the exact production phase-gauge kernel, proves the differentiated gauge identity and an inverse-free regularized completion, and bounds the nonlinear leakage by C_*|a|^2|G| with C_*=1.5397534378598672. For whole-shell predictable controls, one sequence Holder and one weighted AM--GM step pay the matched strict-past same-shell diagonal with one Cameron--Martin allocation, one terminal sextic allocation, and one cutoff-independent integrable random constant whose sixth-moment tail is O(N_j0^-3). Exact terminal expansion nevertheless leaves three off-diagonal families. An independent production fixture makes their combined magnitude more than 4087 times the diagonal, so diagonal-to-terminal collapse is false. The largest-shell triangular off-diagonal Carleson/telescope bound, finite-energy extension, controlled-shell one-use, and the q=10/9 Nelson theorem remain open.",
